<p>Akber ne ye sheh se kaha dam toot raha hai<br />
Hat jaaiye baba mera dam toot raha hai</p>

<p>Juz sabr ke chaarah nahi aye qibla o kaaba<br />
ab rone se kya faaeda dam toot raha hai</p>

<p>Chehre pa mere mout ka aaya hai pasina<br />
bas ho chuka ab qaatema dam toot raha hai</p>

<p>baba mere jeene se utha leejiye ab aas<br />
seene se lahu beh gaya dam toot raha hai</p>

<p>Barchi ki ani reh gayi hai seene me mere<br />
dam toot raha hai mera dam toot raha hai</p>

<p>Atthaara baras paalne waali se na kehna<br />
ran me tere farzand ka dam toot raha hai</p>